  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;(税効果会計関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;１．繰延税金資産及び繰延税金負債の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(繰延税金資産)&lt;/p&gt;
